# Documentation maintenance (mandatory)

**YOU MUST MAINTAIN DOCUMENTATION AS PART OF EVERY CHANGE.**

- **Before starting work:** `git pull` and read `docs/MASTER_PLAN.md`, `docs/`, and `docs/guides/` for the latest ✅ DONE · 🚧 IN PROGRESS · 📝 PLANNED status.
- **After every change:** update `docs/MASTER_PLAN.md` and relevant guides in the **same commit**. Move checkboxes, add changelog lines with date and short note.
- **New ideas or decisions** from the owner (Adhuhaam) go into `docs/MASTER_PLAN.md` immediately (Planned section or Open items).
- **Never leave docs out of date.** Code and docs must agree.
- **Commit and push docs frequently.** The owner edits and pushes docs from many locations. Always pull/rebase first and **merge his edits**; never overwrite them.
- **Every agent and every person must stay on the same page through these docs.**

Product name in docs: **JACMS** (JA CRM). Code identifiers may still say `nexcrm` until the rename milestone is complete — call that out when documenting commands.
